                                "sense_id": "56bd8aa4-45fb-3895-b78d-7f9d85cff732",
                                "text": "Their mission in life was to tote bituminous coal out of the mountain fastness of West Virginia and move it west to the gateways of Deepwater, Columbus and Toledo and east to tidewater at Hampton Roads."
